{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And he said: Show me, I pray You, Your glory.</b> He asked to see in an actual vision the glory of HaShem. And it is possible that \"Your glory\" here is the great glory, the illuminating speculum (aspaklaria). And YHWH answered him: <b>I will make pass</b> the attribute of <b>all My goodness before your face</b> — that you may comprehend it and meditate upon all My goodness more than any other man, for the sight of the face that you asked to see, you will not be able to see."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:20:54.910015654Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}